1. ⚠️ `_dart_duration_seconds` substring-matches `seconds` inside `milliseconds` (`Duration(milliseconds: 3000)` → 3003.0s) — contradicts the helper's own docstring and can spuriously red the AC4 coupling REG on a benign unit change (`\b` fix).
