    );
    // The first event landed: tier-2 is over, the stream heartbeat is
    // the signal now.
    await waitForIt(
      () => !cli.reasoningLivenessActiveForTest,
      reason: 'tier-2 disarms at the first event',
    );

    // Tick before the threshold: silent.
