/// trackers (the tick seam owns the chain state and can never
/// double-fire with the production leg). The E6 fallback
/// (`toolLivenessSeconds` <= 0 → [defaultToolLivenessSeconds], never a
/// spin) is applied inside `_evaluate`.
```

